WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
Dear gentlemen

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,600
Miss Ping'er will perform Farewell to the Ten Mountains for everyone today

3
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:13,300
This is my best song

4
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:16,020
She didn't react well at all

5
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,260
Nice talk, Miss Ping'er

6
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:18,860
Thank you for your love, gentlemen

7
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:20,660
If there is a young master who can follow this song

8
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:22,260
Write words that satisfy the slave family

9
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:23,460
You can sing with your slave tonight

10
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:24,460
Bingzhu Changtan

11
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:25,740
You must be able to catch a glimpse of Fang Rong

12
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:28,640
Can I see your face first?

13
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:32,440
I'm afraid this young master is not convenient for Fang Yao. Don't be embarrassed here.

14
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:34,440
What qualifications does my general have to teach me a lesson?

15
00:00:34,440 --> 00:00:35,640
Thank you two gentlemen for your kindness

16
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:36,560
Everyone who comes is a guest

17
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:38,600
The slave family really can’t meet each other now

18
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:39,800
But the poems of Mr. Ruofang

19
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:40,880
Can satisfy the slave family

20
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:41,880
The slave family makes himself a master

21
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:44,520
It's so good to make an exception

22
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:47,120
Hurry up and write poetry

23
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:48,800
Don't show off your hands here

24
00:00:49,430 --> 00:00:51,590
The tower behind the dream

25
00:00:51,590 --> 00:00:53,670
The old tree hangs low after being sober

26
00:00:54,950 --> 00:00:56,550
So ordinary

27
00:00:56,550 --> 00:00:57,790
Also considered poetry
